    "menu.folderSync": "\u{1F9F2} Folder diff & push",
    "features.dFolderSync": "Pair a folder on this machine with a folder on a server: a diff table by modified time and size so you can see which side is newer, push the changed files with one button, and with watching on, saving a file uploads it",
    "folderSync.title": "Folder diff & push",
    "folderSync.hint": "For editing PHP/WordPress code locally and getting it onto the server: the diff compares modified time and size (no checksums, so it costs the server nothing) and pushes ONE WAY, machine \u2192 server. A file that is newer on the server is only flagged, never pulled down \u2014 usually it means somebody edited it there directly.",
